<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's April PPI rises 3.8 pct - government.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's April PPI rises 3.8 pct - government.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 3.8 percent in April on the year, up from a 2.0 percent year-on-year rise a year earlier, Ministry of Finance and Economy figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					  April    March     April '96</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +3.8     +3.8	+2.0</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    -0.4     -0.2	+0.4</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 123.7    123.2     119.2</p>
<p>The ministry said the PPI rose 3.5 percent in 1996, against 3.4 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
